OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after two die in car and
OL,4,Alorry crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 59-year-old arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing death by careless driving while
OL,8,Funfit through drink or drugs had since
OL,9,Fbeen released on bail as inquiries
OL,10,Fcontinued, the force added.
